00:00:27.788 --> 00:00:29.137
SECOND LOCKED DOWN IN NEW YORK.

00:00:29.139 --> 00:00:30.797
BUT THEY ARE NOT EVEN TRYING.

00:00:30.831 --> 00:00:32.769
BY THE WAY THE CONCERN FROM DAY

