JOINING US TONIGHT THE FOX

00:00:49.713 --> 00:00:50.215
MEDICAL CONTRIBUTOR

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:51.778
DR. MARC SIEGEL.

00:00:51.779 --> 00:00:53.118
