00:01:13.057 --> 00:01:15.838
EXCEPT WHEN SHE WENT ELBOW TO

00:01:15.840 --> 00:01:17.299
ELBOW WITH THE PROTESTERS.

00:01:17.333 --> 00:01:19.035
WHEN ONE OF THE REPRESENTATIVE

00:01:19.037 --> 00:01:20.242
STATE REPRESENTATIVES FROM

00:01:20.277 --> 00:01:21.797
