00:01:21.832 --> 00:01:23.333
SOCIAL DISTANCING IS CRITICAL

00:01:23.367 --> 00:01:25.043
UNLESS YOU HAVE A GREAT PHOTO

00:01:25.044 --> 00:01:25.274
UP.

00:01:25.309 --> 00:01:26.160
HERE IN NEW YORK STATE,

00:01:26.162 --> 00:01:27.944
GOVERNOR CUOMO USES THE STICK

00:01:27.978 --> 00:01:28.583
AND THE CARROT.

00:01:28.618 --> 00:01:29.788
THIS MORNING TO STICK, NEW YORK

00:01:29.823 --> 00:01:31.881
WE MAY LOCK YOU DOWN AGAIN.

00:01:31.915 --> 00:01:34.362
IF YOU DON’T CUT IT OUT.

00:01:34.396 --> 00:01:36.387
THIS AFTERNOON HE USED THE

00:01:36.389 --> 00:01:38.185
CARROT, PLACES WHERE HE

00:01:38.219 --> 00:01:40.572
MENTIONED UP TO 25 PEOPLE CAN

00:01:40.573 --> 00:01:40.799
GATHER.

00:01:40.801 --> 00:01:42.218
THE CARROT AND A STICK.

00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:44.021
WHEN IT COMES TO THE CONTACT

00:01:44.022 --> 00:01:45.916
TRACING YOU ARE TALKING ABOUT,

00:01:45.917 --> 00:01:46.886
THIS IS DEEPLY DISTURBING,

00:01:46.887 --> 00:01:47.317
TUCKER.

00:01:47.318 --> 00:01:49.197
BECAUSE IT’S AT THE HEART OF

00:01:49.198 --> 00:01:50.237
PUBLIC HEALTH.

00:01:50.239 --> 00:01:52.131
BUT A SPOKESPERSON FOR

00:01:52.132 --> 00:01:53.921
MAYOR de BLASIO SAID THE

00:01:53.956 --> 00:01:55.891
CONTACT TRACING IN THE CITY WILL

00:01:55.926 --> 00:01:57.588
NOT BE PROACTIVE.

00:01:57.623 --> 00:01:59.455
PROACTIVE ABOUT WHETHER YOU

00:01:59.456 --> 00:02:01.545
ATTENDED A PROTEST OR NOT.

00:02:01.579 --> 00:02:02.801
BUT PROACTIVITY IS THE VERY

00:02:02.802 --> 00:02:04.682
ESSENCE OF CONTACT TRACING.

00:02:04.684 --> 00:02:06.168
LET ME GIVE YOU AN EXAMPLE.

00:02:06.203 --> 00:02:08.494
DOWN IN CAPE MAY OVER THE

00:02:08.529 --> 00:02:09.697
