00:02:12.935 --> 00:02:14.474
THE LOCAL PUBLIC HEALTH

00:02:14.475 --> 00:02:15.652
OFFICIALS ZOOMED IN AND CHECKED

00:02:15.687 --> 00:02:17.495
EVERYBODY AT THE PARTY.

00:02:17.529 --> 00:02:20.314
THEY FOUND OUT WHO HAD IT, WHO

00:02:20.315 --> 00:02:22.326
WAS CONTACTED BY THEM, THEY

00:02:22.360 --> 00:02:23.487
ISOLATED THEM AND PREVENTED

00:02:23.522 --> 00:02:24.180
FURTHER SPREAD.

00:02:24.214 --> 00:02:26.157
OBVIOUSLY THAT APPLIES TO THE

00:02:26.158 --> 00:02:28.327
PROTESTERS AND OBVIOUSLY, THAT

00:02:28.362 --> 00:02:29.866
IS WHAT NEW YORK CITY

00:02:29.867 --> 00:02:30.899
CONTRACT TRACING SHOULD BE IS

00:02:30.900 --> 00:02:32.808
BEING PROACTIVE AND WERE YOU IN

00:02:32.809 --> 00:02:34.919
THAT CROWD, WHAT DID YOU DO IN

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:37.610
THAT CROWD, WHO WERE YOU WITHIN

00:02:37.612 --> 00:02:38.418
THAT CROWD?

00:02:38.453 --> 00:02:39.536
TUCKER, MY PRESCRIPTION FOR

00:02:39.570 --> 00:02:40.486
